 weight type and K) run as one ksplit launch on RDNA3_0, the rows of the
 smaller weights appended after the largest; a row_cat template instance (the
 plain kernels are unchanged: an in-kernel check cost q36 2 %). Gate: small_m
 and rows per block agree for each weight and the total. Bit-identical;
 Qwen3-30B tg128 +3.2 %, Qwen3.6 flat on 7900 XTX. GGML_CUDA_MMVQ_ROW_CONCAT=0
 off

